const description: { en: string; ja: string } = {"en":"Two battle axes in a ring, mirror images, their long handles crossed below and their heads up and out. A head is the ground between four circles and three ruled lines: the round top of the bevel, the line of its back, the blade's round, the lower outer curve, the line of its foot, the line of its inner side and the arch both heads share over the crossing. A white wavy line runs from the point of the blade to the foot of the head, and three white strokes lie on the blade. A handle is 8 wide with square ends, leaning 42 degrees; under its own head it leaves a white gap of 2, and at the crossing the rising handle lies over the falling one with the same gap. The left head is built first and the right where it stands; the ring is the medium ring, with a thin white line between it and the axes.","ja":"二本の鉞（まさかり）を輪の中に左右対称に置き、長い柄を下で交差させ、頭を上と外に向けます。頭は、四つの円と三本の直線ではさんだ部分です。刃の上の丸み、背の線、刃の丸み、下の外側の曲線、足の線、内側の線、そして二つの頭が交差の上で分け合う一つのアーチです。刃の先から頭の足まで白い波線を一本引き、刃の面には白い線を三本入れます。柄は幅8で先が四角く、42度に傾けます。自分の頭の下では幅2の白いすき間を空け、交差のところでは、右上がりの柄を上にして、同じ幅のすき間を空けます。左の頭を先に作図し、右の頭はその場で作図します。輪は中くらいの太さで、鉞との間に細い白線一本分のすき間を空けます。"};

export default construction;
